            "right_description": "<ol><li>Start by gripping your hoop with your right hand, underhand, at the top point of your hoop.</li><li>First position: Move the hoop to the right side of your body.</li><li>Second position: Rotate your hoop up to hold it by the bottom of the hoop in an over hand position.</li><li>Third position: Rotate your hoop across your body and down so that you are holding it by the top of the hoop in over hand position.</li><li>Fourth Position: Rotate your hoop clockwise to hold it underhand by the bottom of the hoop.</li><li>Rotate back to First position and repeat.</li></ol>",
