            "right_heading_tag": "h3",
            "right_description": "<ol><li>Use your right hand to hoop clockwise and your left hand to hoop counterclockwise.</li><li>Grab the hoop in front of you with both hands underhanded.</li><li>Carry the hoop around your body while twisting your arm in the other direction.</li><li>Hand the hoop off behind your back.</li><li>Twist your arm in the opposite direction to the continued rotation around your body.</li><li>Hand the hoop off in front of your body and repeat.</li></ol>",
