            "right_description": "<ol><li>Begin by hooping in Lasso Position on your left hand.</li><li>Find the hole of the hoop in front of your body. </li><li>Insert your right hand into the hoop while also bringing the hoop down to belly button level with your left hand. </li><li>Push it across your body to orbit around your waist.  </li></ol>",
            "right_custom_block_padding": "50px 20px 50px 20px",
            "right_enable_custom_text_color": true,
