            "left_title": "Intermediate Hula Hoop Trick: Pizza Toss Somersault Catch",
            "left_heading_tag": "h3",
            "left_description": "<p>Pizza Toss Somersault Catch move involves the quick succession of throwing the hoop, somersaulting and catching the hoop.</p>",
            "left_custom_block_padding": "50px 20px 50px 20px",
            "left_enable_custom_text_color": true,
            "left_custom_text_color": "#000000",
            "left_enable_custom_link_color": false,
            "left_custom_link_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "left_video_url": "https://youtu.be/JIcLg5Cs8dA",
            "left_content_alignment": "top-left",
            "left_background_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "right_title": "",
            "right_heading_tag": "h3",
            "right_description": "<ol><li>Begin by coming out of the Vortex and tossing the hoop into the air a few feet in front of you. </li><li>Immediately do a somersault. </li><li>Catch the hoop upon completion of the somersault and continue hooping in Lasso.</li></ol>",
            "right_custom_block_padding": "50px 20px 50px 20px",
            "right_enable_custom_text_color": true,
            "right_custom_text_color": "#000000",
            "right_enable_custom_link_color": false,
            "right_custom_link_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
