            "background_image_size": "cover",
            "section_margin": 50,
            "min_height": 200,
            "left_title": "Advanced Hula Hoop Trick: Pizza Toss Warp",
            "left_heading_tag": "h3",
            "left_description": "<p>Pizza Toss Warp is a trick that involves initiating a Pizza Toss and then jumping through the hoop before it hits the ground.</p>",
            "left_custom_block_padding": "50px 20px 50px 20px",
            "left_enable_custom_text_color": true,
            "left_custom_text_color": "#000000",
            "left_enable_custom_link_color": false,
            "left_custom_link_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "left_video_url": "https://youtu.be/R_ehmevm6Tc",
            "left_content_alignment": "top-left",
            "left_background_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "right_title": "",
            "right_heading_tag": "h3",
            "right_description": "<ol><li>Begin by doing a Pizza Toss throw. Throw your hoop high directly above you.</li><li> As the hoop is above you in the air, locate the hole of the hoop. Reposition your body to prepare to jump through the hoop. </li><li>Bend your knees and jump right through the hoop as the hoop makes its way down.</li><li>As the hoop reaches waist to chest level grab the hoop underhand with your left hand. </li><li>As you hold your hoop at your right side, stretch your left arm diagonally across your body. </li><li>Lift and tuck your legs close to your body as you jump through the hoop. </li><li> Tilt the hoop downward revolving it to the right to finish your jump through. </li><li>Hand the hoop off to your right hand  and continue passing the hoop around your body. </li></ol>",
            "right_custom_block_padding": "50px 20px 50px 20px",
            "right_enable_custom_text_color": true,
            "right_custom_text_color": "#000000",
            "right_enable_custom_link_color": false,
            "right_custom_link_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "right_video_url": "",
            "right_content_alignment": "top-left",
