            "min_height": 200,
            "left_title": "Advanced Hula Hoop Trick: Foot Lasso",
            "left_heading_tag": "h3",
            "left_description": "<p>Foot Lasso involves spinning the hoop in a lasso position with your foot, above your head.</p>",
            "left_custom_block_padding": "50px 20px 50px 20px",
            "left_enable_custom_text_color": false,
            "left_custom_text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "left_enable_custom_link_color": false,
            "left_custom_link_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "left_video_url": "https://youtu.be/_YHEFAT3NDM",
            "left_content_alignment": "top-left",
            "left_background_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "right_title": "",
            "right_heading_tag": "h3",
            "right_description": "<ol><li>Begin by passing the hoop around your body. </li><li>Go into a foot pass carrying the hoop to the side of your body. Carry the hoop on your foot between your toys and ankle.</li><li>While the hoop is at the side of your body, place your hands in the air, bend over and touch the ground.</li><li>Pull the hoop behind you with the side of your foot. Point your foot in the air. </li><li>Continue to lasso the hoop around your foot.</li></ol>",
            "right_custom_block_padding": "50px 20px 50px 20px",
            "right_enable_custom_text_color": false,
            "right_custom_text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
