            "overlay_opacity": 0,
            "background_image_size": "cover",
            "section_margin": 50,
            "min_height": 200,
            "left_title": "Things to remember when learning hula hoop tricks",
            "left_heading_tag": "h3",
            "left_description": "<ul><li><strong>Get creative.</strong> The more you get creative and think outside the box, the more you are going to enjoy.</li><li><strong>Hoop with a friend.</strong> It can be more fun to master new tricks when someone is learning them with you!</li><li><strong>Be patient.</strong> It takes time to build your hoop stamina so amp up your speed by intensifying your torso rotation.</li><li><strong>Don’t give up.</strong> These tricks might take time, and you’ll be doing fantastic hula hoop tricks before you know it!</li></ul>",
            "left_custom_block_padding": "20px",
            "left_enable_custom_text_color": true,
            "left_custom_text_color": "#000000",
            "left_enable_custom_link_color": false,
            "left_custom_link_color": "#f92e82",
            "left_video_url": "",
            "left_content_alignment": "top-left",
            "left_background_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "right_title": "",
            "right_heading_tag": "h3",
            "right_description": "<p>Be sure to check back later because we will be adding more hula hooping tricks over time. Remember that regular practice helps but play is important, too! If you keep at it, you’ll be making up your own hula hoop tricks in no time.</p><p>A big “Thank You!” to <a href=\"https://www.hoopsmiles.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Hoop Smiles</a> for all of the great video tutorials!</p><h3>Happy hooping!</h3>",
            "right_custom_block_padding": "20px",
